ämme ragen aus dem Wasser, darüber das dichte Kronendach mit einzelnen Urwaldriesen. Auf der Rückfahrt geht es mitten durch die überfluteten Randbäume.", "en": "In the Anavilhanas Archipelago on the Rio Negro, one of the largest river archipelagos in the world, opposite Novo Airão: out and back through a channel between two long islands, close to the forest edge. At high water the island trees stand in the black water of the Rio Negro, trunks rising from the water beneath a dense canopy with the odd emergent giant. On the way back you row right through the flooded trees along the edge."}, "highlights": [{"name": {"de": "Igapó-Wald am Inselrand", "en": "Igapó forest on the island edge"}, "side": "links", "note": {"de": "Bäume stehen im Wasser", "en": "trees standing in the water"}}, {"name": {"de": "Urwaldriesen", "en": "Emergent giants"}, "side": "links", "note": {"de": "einzelne Bäume über 30 m", "en": "single trees over 30 m"}}, {"name": {"de": "Gegenüberliegende Insel", "en": "Opposite island"}, "side": "rechts", "note": {"de": "Kanal 150–300 m breit", "en": "channel 150–300 m wide"}}], "minimap": {"image": "minimap.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-659.05, -1745.26, 2082.89, 996.69]}, "overview": {"image": "overview.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-2852.6, -3938.81, 4276.44, 3190.24]}, "traffic": {"vessels": ["motorboot"], "density": 0.4, "rower_lanes": [{"out_m": -30.0, "back_m": -21.0, "turn_out_m": -38.0, "turn_back_m": -22.0}, {"out_m": -39.0, "back_m": -12.0, "turn_out_m": -46.0, "turn_back_m": -14.0}], "vessel_lanes": [{"id": "p32-1", "kind": "parallel", "min_dist_m": 290.7, "shore_m": 21.7, "points_xz": [[-982.9, -880.8], [-682.4, -804.9]]}, {"id": "p-64-2", "kind": "parallel", "min_dist_m": 57.0, "shore_m": 21.3, "points_xz": [[-1006.5, -787.8], [-417.3, -638.8], [-334.7, -611.1], [-258.0, -582.6], [-209.0, -567.4], [-138.6, -550.2], [-116.8, -543.4], [-34.3, -506.1], [22.8, -488.2], [164.3, -436.0], [229.6, -417.1], [290.3, -387.7], [315.0, -378.6], [349.8, -369.8], [395.4, -36